OL,3,GNEWSAI couldn't live with the agony of
OL,4,Amigraines any more but my GP called me
OL,5,Adramatic
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: This article contains details
OL,8,Fand references to suicide
OL,10,FWhen Lauren Evans told her doctor she
OL,11,Fwas suicidal because of the "pure
OL,12,Fagony" of her chronic migraine, she was
OL,13,Ftold she was being dramatic.
OL,15,FLauren, 29, was seven when she got her
OL,16,Ffirst migraine and went on to have them
OL,17,Fregularly - by the time she was 24,
OL,18,Fthey were happening every day.
OL,20,F"People need to understand that a
OL,21,Fmigraine is a full body experience,"
OL,22,Fshe said.
